# Thresholds

Configure:

| Color | Value | Meaning |
|--------|------:|---------|
| 🟢 Green | 2 | Expected number of Pods |
| 🟡 Yellow | 1 | Reduced redundancy |
| 🔴 Red | 0 | No healthy Pods |

> **Note:** Adjust these thresholds to match your deployment's desired replica count. For example, if your Deployment is configured with three replicas, you may use green at **3** instead of **2**.

