---

# Testing the Panel

Scale the Deployment.

```bash
kubectl scale deployment auth-service \
--replicas=3 \
-n auth
```

Wait a few moments.

The panel should update automatically.

```
3
```

Scale again.

```bash
kubectl scale deployment auth-service \
--replicas=5 \
-n auth
```

Expected

```
5
```

This confirms that Grafana is correctly monitoring Kubernetes.

